From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:06:37 +0000
Subject: fix(a11y): hide invisible and flattened semantics subtrees

Add AccessibilityRole.HIDDEN and emit it for nodes marked invisibleToUser
and for every native node under a hidden layout ancestor, including
descendants flattened across merge/clear boundaries. Role-less nodes
without text now get NONE, and stale label/info is always overwritten.
Android maps "hidden" to IMPORTANT_FOR_ACCESSIBILITY_NO_HIDE_DESCENDANTS,
also when a testTag is set, and strips focus/actions from the node info.

Fork-Patch: a11y-hide-invisible-semantics-subtrees
Origin: 191d1b93 04fa0d11 c3194762 5ea4bb32
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

